{\b aBookPlayer}\par
\par
Audiobook player with chapters, subtitles and local speech-to-text transcription.\par
\par
Copyright (c) 2026 Marco Trombetta. Released under the MIT License: you may use, copy, modify and distribute it freely, provided this notice is kept.\par
\par
{\b Privacy}\par
aBookPlayer does not collect or send any data. Audio files never leave your computer: transcription runs locally. The only network access is the optional, one-time download of a Whisper speech model from Hugging Face and of GPU support (the Vulkan build of whisper.cpp) from nuget.org, which happen only after you confirm them, and a check for a newer version on GitHub at most once a day, which sends only the app's version (turn it off in the Help menu).\par
\par
Settings are stored in %APPDATA%\\aBookPlayer; downloaded models and GPU support in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\aBookPlayer. They are kept when the app is uninstalled; delete those folders to remove them.\par
\par
